<section id="S5" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">5 </span>Conclusion</h2>

<div id="S5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this paper, we present FAQ, a QA benchmark focused on leveraging the potential of temporal inconsistencies in deepfake videos for VLMs to learn.
Starting with manual annotation, we use a comprehensive process to convert static annotations into questions and answers related to temporal information.
Thanks to carefully designed task definitions and distractors, these QAs effectively evaluate models’ temporal reasoning capability for deepfake videos.
We validated that our dataset can effectively enhance model’s performance on deepfake detection tasks and temporal reasoning tasks through training.</p>
</div>
</section>
