<div id="S7.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S7.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt for Generating QA in Level 1.</span>
This prompt constructs Region Perception and Edge Perception tasks with visually plausible distractors.</p>
