<section id="S8" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">8 </span>Modeling Details</h2>

<div id="S8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The models and corresponding parameters used for training and evaluation are presented in <a href="#S8.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ 8 Modeling Details ‣ Beyond Static Artifacts: A Forensic Benchmark for Video Deepfake Reasoning in Vision Language Models" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
